### 变量定义
@apiKey = AIzaSyDaEyji1q1hMvOe9wSQ_wFSbwn_4aQrmDI
@baseUrl = https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta

### 1. 测试：列出所有可用模型 (ListModels)
# 这个请求能直接告诉你，Google 服务器现在到底支持哪些模型名字
GET {{baseUrl}}/models?key={{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. 测试：尝试调用 Gemini 1.5 Flash
# 如果上面列表里有 gemini-1.5-flash，再试这个
POST {{baseUrl}}/models/gemini-2.5-flash:generateContent?key=AIzaSyDaEyji1q1hMvOe9wSQ_wFSbwn_4aQrmDI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contents": [{
    "parts": [{
      "text": "Tell me who are you.And Lists The Models That i can use for free"
    }]
  }]
}

### 3. 测试：尝试调用 Gemini 1.0 Pro (保底)
POST {{baseUrl}}/models/gemini-2.0-flash:generateContent?key=AIzaSyDaEyji1q1hMvOe9wSQ_wFSbwn_4aQrmDI
Content-Type: application/json

{
